 "remarks": "FEELS LIKE YOUR PRIVATE COTTAGE! Immaculate + Pretty, this newer, updated apartment feels like your own private home! Located in sought-after Westwood, you'll enjoy an open designer kitchen with new granite countertops + stainless steel appliances, sunny rooms lined with large windows, cool, new laminate floors, central air, gas heat, excellent closet space and personal, in-unit washer & dryer.  THERE ARE NO ADDITIONAL FEES! The popular & elegant Westwood community features impeccable on-site maintenance and grounds care. This fabulous, apartment is pet-friendly, has off-street parking, a small gym and 24-hour security. Pets are Ok, Dogs must be less than 35 Lbs. only, 2-Cats Ok or 1-dog and 1-cat OK ($300 fully refundable pet deposit required). Westwood is a No Smoking Community. Please have interested prospects submit the Westwood application uploaded in supplements with a credit check through Rentspree or Applyconnect only.  This apartment has just been vacated and quickly being made to sparkle!",
